	<h1> =20
		create Font List using Word
	</h1> =20


	<p>  =20
		Create a list of your installed fonts in a new Word Document=20
		showing examples of what characters look like in each=20
		using a VBA procedure that's easy to run from the Word DOCM download.
	</p>=09
	<p> 	=09
		In the document that's created,
		scan down to find a font that you like the look of.
		You can also=20
		copy characters  =20
		and paste wherever you want,
		as well as get information.	=09
	</p>

